sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend as React App
    participant API as Server
    participant Worker as Email Worker
    participant DB as Database

    User->>Frontend: Submit forgot-password(email)
    Frontend->>API: POST /auth/users/requester/password
    API->>DB: find user by email
    alt user exists & not banned
        API->>DB: store reset code + expiry
        API->>Worker: queue password-reset email
        Worker-->>User: sends reset email
    else
        API-->>Frontend: 200 (generic response)
    end
    User->>Frontend: Submit reset form (email, code, newPassword)
    Frontend->>API: POST /auth/users/resetter/password
    API->>DB: fetch user by email, verify code & expiry
    alt valid
        API->>DB: update password, clear reset code
        API-->>Frontend: 200 success
    else
        API-->>Frontend: 403 error
    end
